    <color name="serupa_field_border_hover">#FFA1A1AA</color> <!-- Alias. Field border on hover: the resting `field-border` one gray step stronger (zinc-400 in light, zinc-600 in dark), so the field answers the pointer without taking the accent, which stays for focus. -->
